        "text": "=You are an advanced Customer Complaint Resolution AI. Analyze the customer's complaint below to extract the required triage metrics.\n\nCustomer Name: {{ $('Complaint Intake').item.json.body.customer_name }}\nComplaint Text:\n{{ $('Complaint Intake').item.json.body.complaint_text }}\n\nRULES:\n1. Determine the category (e.g., Billing Issue, Delivery Delay, Product Damage, Customer Service).\n2. Assess priority (Critical, High, Medium, Low).\n3. Evaluate sentiment (Anger, Frustrated, Neutral).\n4. Flag \"legal_risk\" as true ONLY if the customer explicitly mentions suing, lawyers, regulatory bodies, or taking legal action. Otherwise, false.\n5. Write a 1-sentence executive recommendation on how to resolve this.",
